# What `railway up` must never upload. .dockerignore guards the IMAGE; this
# guards the archive sent to Railway before any image exists. Secrets reach the
# service as its variables (docs/hosting.md), never as files.
**/.env
**/.env.*
# NAME.env too: backend/mainnet.env holds the mainnet attester, aadi.env a wallet key.
**/*.env
!**/.env.example
**/*.key
backend/.stack
backend/deploy/config
backend/mesh/deploy/config
frontend/public/stack.json
**/node_modules
contracts/lib
contracts/out
contracts/cache
frontend/public/xrpl-stack.json
# A local build; the XRPL image makes its own.
frontend/dist
